00:04:57.050 --> 00:04:58.070
How are you?

00:04:58.070 --> 00:04:59.740
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Very
happy to have you.

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:03.350
So we're going to be talking
about many different things.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:05.064
