00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:04.030
I could have network.

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:04.780
INES ENVID: Cloud.

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:05.738
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Cloud.

00:18:05.738 --> 00:18:06.320
Oh, right.

00:18:06.320 --> 00:18:07.260
Oh, wow.

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:09.530
INES ENVID: Yeah, you build
a cloud, but it's virtual

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:12.380
and it's private, so it
