00:20:34.732 --> 00:20:38.670
It gives you the illusion that
it's all your infrastructure.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:41.370
You can actually
secure it and make sure

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:43.490
that it's not accessible
by anyone else.

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:45.720
Gives you the isolation
