00:32:30.630 --> 00:32:31.690
on the shoulder of giants--

00:32:31.690 --> 00:32:32.350
MARK MANDEL: Yeah, exactly.

00:32:32.350 --> 00:32:33.090
FRANCESC CAMPOY:
--same topic again.

00:32:33.090 --> 00:32:34.090
Yeah, wonderful.

00:32:34.090 --> 00:32:34.460
